MegaST - Atari ST/STe for MEGA65
================================

MEGA65 port done in 2026 by Chris Freeman

https://github.com/freemchr/MegaST

MegaST is licensed under the terms of GNU/GPL v3, for more information please read the file LICENSE
Parts of MegaST are licensed under other Free-software licenses as described in the source code

MegaST:
-------

  MegaST is a port of MiSTer's AtariST core ("Atari ST/STe for MiSTer")
      done by the MiSTer Development Team
      Original GitHub Repository: https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/AtariST_MiSTer
      Significant contributors:
      * Gyorgy Szombathelyi (gyurco): MiSTery core, GSTMCU, shifter, DMA, MiSTer port
      * Alexey Melnikov (Sorgelig): MiSTer framework and maintenance, YM2149
      * Till Harbaum: original MiST Atari ST core, FDC 1772, ACSI, MFP, IKBD, Viking card, Mega STe control

  MiSTer's AtariST core is a port of MiSTery, the Atari ST/STe core for the MiST board
      done by Gyorgy Szombathelyi, based on the MiST Atari ST core by Till Harbaum
      Original GitHub Repository: https://github.com/gyurco/MiSTery

  Significant parts of the core:
      * FX68K, cycle accurate 68000 CPU: Jorge Cwik (ijor)
        https://github.com/ijor/fx68k
      * Cycle accurate ST Blitter and shifter decap: Jorge Cwik
      * GSTMCU, based on the schematics recovered by Christian Zietz: Gyorgy Szombathelyi
      * HD63701 CPU of the real IKBD: Tsuyoshi Hasegawa
      * YM2149 sound chip: MikeJ and Sorgelig
      * MFP USART: Wolfgang Foerster

Other than that and my own work, MegaST uses:
---------------------------------------------

  * MiSTer2MEGA65 by The MiSTer2MEGA65 Development Team
    https://github.com/sy2002/MiSTer2MEGA65

  * QNICE Co-Processor and System-on-a-Chip for file operations and on-screen-menu by The QNICE Development Team
    https://github.com/sy2002/QNICE-FPGA

  * Various MEGA65 drivers taken from the MEGA65 VHDL source by Paul Gardner-Stephen
    https://github.com/MEGA65/mega65-core

  * VGA Timing Generator, done by Scott Larson
    https://www.digikey.com/eewiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=15925278

  * VGA to HDMI converter IP core, done by Adam Barnes
    https://github.com/amb5l/tyto2

  * AVALON SCALER used for scaling to 720p for HDMI, done by temlib.org
    http://temlib.org/site/?page_id=10

  * HyperRAM controller, done by MJoergen
    https://mjoergen.github.io/HyperRAM/

  * Debouncer: I/O debouncing used for the joysticks, done by Scott Larson
    https://www.digikey.com/eewiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=4980758

  * Anikki-16x16 font, archived and provided by k80w
    https://github.com/k80w/consolefonts

  * PSF font to text file converter nafe-0.1 by Corvus Corax
    https://sourceforge.net/projects/nafe/

  * PSF font to C include file converter psftools-1.1.1 by John Elliott
    https://www.seasip.info/Unix/PSF/
